{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drop cute animals into a box, pack as many in as you can, but if two of the same collide they'll merge into a larger animal!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/InLineTitle-About.png?t=1747275641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zooika is a delightful casual game where you'll encounter a parade of adorable animals! But watch out! These critters aren't happy when they meet their twin, match two animals of the same kind and POP! They'll combine to form a brand new, even larger animal! It's your job to strategically contain them all.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/Zooika_SteamInline_Popping-optimize.gif?t=1747275641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every critter combined, you'll earn points and build up your score. Zooika is easy to pick up and play, but mastering the art of animal combination will take some strategic thinking. So, are you ready to box in some fun? Get ready for Zooika! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/InLineTitle-Features.png?t=1747275641\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different sets of animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple play areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic music and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam integrations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994730/extras/Zooika_SteamInline_animals-optimize.gif?t=1747275641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/299473